  "steps": [
    "Take 3 ripe or even overripe bananas and place them between two sheets of baking paper.",
    "Smoosh them down until they’re nice and flat.",
    "Spread 3 tbsp peanut butter evenly over the bananas.",
    "Melt 200g of 70% dark chocolate and spread it all over the top.",
    "Finish with a handful of salted peanuts.",
    "Freeze for at least 1 hour, or until completely set.",
    "Once frozen, chop it into bite-sized squares, and that’s it! The perfect easy 4-ingredient treat to keep in your freezer."
